  "findings": [
    "Nature Melon branch stores NATURE_MELON_SLICE as the returned item; no NATURAL_TEA field reference exists in TeaSink class",
    "Creative passes zero consumption amount; helper returns true before inventory search, so shroom branch wins even without shrooms, once cup/shreddings requirements pass"
  ],
  "acceptance": [
    "If intended, return NATURAL_TEA from melon branch and test consumed/returned item conservation",
    "Separate additive presence from zero-cost Creative consumption; define and test Creative selection",
    "Test no additive, both additives, inventory/offhand positions, missing cup/shreddings, full inventory, filled/empty transition, refill bucket and cup return after drinking",
    "Verify probability helper and actual sink depletion behavior without assuming exactly seven uses"
  ]
